  "independent_transcript": "That I shook the lower footway barrier, that I unfastened it when Tomás called, while he opened the separate upper footway gate, that acting later did not make the earlier closure harmless. I have spent seventeen years rehearsing explanations that end with me having no choice. I will not give you one of those. Ask me what I saw. If I do not know, make me say so.",
